[{"title":"野吏亭","author":"陈尧佐","text":"野吏厌公堂，开轩出郡墙。\n残花炎帝圃，斜日尉佗乡。\n叠巘分诸粤，重城截大荒。\n耕桑蛮聚落，烟火汉封疆。\n云势飘蓬岛，天形压夜郎。\n扁舟闲得侣，嘉树远成行。\n梅雨千林暮，春风百草香。\n人家浮浩淼，鸟道没青苍。\n爽垲吟魂健，虚明夏景凉。\n他年重回首，牢落愧甘棠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15610,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游永明寺","author":"陈尧佐","text":"附郭山光峭若烟，倚空楼殿白云巅。\n孤轩半出青松杪，颢气疑游碧汉边。\n惜别拟留风外燕，伤秋因感雨中蝉。\n人家掩映藏鱼浦，岛树扶疏没水天。\n痛饮岂同莲社客，狂歌聊许竹林贤。\n忘形且尽尊前乐，休忆楼岩与济川。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15611,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆越州 其三","author":"陈尧佐","text":"抽毫欲赋东南奇，云山好景惭有遗。\n平波荡漾照湖渌，扁舟忆得游春时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15612,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"古寺偈","author":"陈尧佐","text":"殿古寒炉空，流尘暗金碧。\n独坐偶无人，又得真消息。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15613,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吴江","author":"陈尧佐","text":"平波渺渺烟苍苍，菰蒲才熟杨柳黄。\n扁舟系岸不忍去，秋风斜日鲈鱼乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15614,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闲步过芳菲园","author":"陈尧佐","text":"尽日芳菲园，不见芳菲好。\n茂草与斜阳，脉脉情多少。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15615,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送潮阳李孜主簿","author":"陈尧佐","text":"潮阳山水东南奇，鱼盐城郭民熙熙。\n当时为撰玄圣碑，而今风俗邹鲁为。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15616,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"踏莎行","author":"陈尧佐","text":"二社良辰，千家庭院。\n翩翩又见新来燕。\n凤凰巢稳许为邻，潇湘烟暝来何晚。\n乱入红楼，低飞绿岸。\n画梁时拂歌尘散。\n为谁归去为谁来，主人恩重珠帘卷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15617,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"陈尧佐","text":"供帐开天苑，传呼度国门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15618,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"陈尧佐","text":"青云歧路游将遍，白发光阴得最多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15619,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"陈尧佐","text":"公馀莫放西湖景，步步苍苔岸岸松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15620,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"陈尧佐","text":"城中三亩宅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15621,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九","author":"陈尧佐","text":"门前碧浪家家海，树上青山寺寺云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15622,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十一","author":"陈尧佐","text":"争似碧澜堂上望，疏疏烟树漠汀洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15623,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"路振","text":"君恩来万里，客路出千山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15624,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其八","author":"陈尧佐","text":"部吏百函通爵里，从兵千骑属鞬櫜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15625,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"陈尧佐","text":"风樵若耶路，霜橘洞庭秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15626,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"陈尧佐","text":"千里好山云乍敛，一楼明月雨初晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15627,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"果实","author":"陈尧叟","text":"甜于糖蜜软于酥，阆苑山头拥万株。\n叶底深藏红玳瑁，枝边低缀碧珊瑚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15628,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"陈尧叟","text":"一榻琴书双门寺，片心泉石两林山。\n江楼把酒云供望，秋院支筇鹤对閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15629,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"披云亭","author":"陈尧叟","text":"秦关百二山河固，陕服城闉控此中。\n别构栋梁成爽垲，俯观竹树立青葱。\n虚檐豁敞迎朝日，曲槛萦回带晚风。\n登眺自欣襟带地，万方辙迹坦然同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15630,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送崇教大师南归","author":"陈尧叟","text":"能名净行达理闱，振锡携瓶出翠微。\n恩重冕旒曾召对，情高云鹤却同归。\n会思莲社寰中结，杯泛潮风海上飞。\n不是清时未陈力，便堪随去扫岩扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15631,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题义门胡氏华林书院","author":"陈尧叟","text":"旌阙书亭焕水乡，四时烟景似沧浪。\n玉浆寒色连莎砌，金障秋阴覆草堂。\n田里从来应逊畔，儿孙游戏亦成行。\n吾君孝理风天下，谁识讴歌缀乐章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15632,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赓上赐病归韵","author":"陈尧叟","text":"寅会丁昌运，吁谟愧琐才。\n微功酬帝造，迈级处公台。\n辞位囊封上，逾涯宠数来。\n维藩分圣寄，涕泗远丹台。\n旌仰宸章降，隆弥睿眷回。\n载赓诚寡和，望阙几徘徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15633,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"妙智洞","author":"陈尧叟","text":"追忆经行三十年，漫山桃李竞争妍。\n于今棠棣花成萼，我已童颜射酒船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15634,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"洞霄宫","author":"陈尧叟","text":"回合烟光叠翠屏，东南山水此为灵。\n莺花春学蓬瀛境，楼阁夜干牛斗星。\n古桧森罗烧药灶，彩云飘洒聚仙亭。\n辽天俯近归期鹤，澥谷旁连骇巨溟。\n紫陌红尘无一点，绿毛仙骨有千龄。\n当时听法谈玄者，环佩锵锵拱上清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15635,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送张无梦归天台","author":"陈尧叟","text":"山人之所隐，临海赤城閒。\n天台峰峨峨，剡水声潺潺。\n绝顶一室非尘寰，忘形终日同云閒。\n仙軿每戾止，人迹绝跻攀。\n沆瀣挹朝味，冰雪留童颜。\n手持百首还元诗，诗成自谓人不知。\n世人得之蹈，希夷自此游，朝市皆争识形仪。\n承祯以道遇明主，子训卖药归会稽。\n张君今能尽继之。\n冥冥孤鸿东南飞，邈然不负烟霞期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15636,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"普济院","author":"陈尧咨","text":"山远峰峰碧，林疏叶叶红。\n凭阑对僧语，如在画图中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15637,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"草堂寺诗","author":"陈尧咨","text":"□□□迹□禅关，□殿清虚桧影间。\n客□□临来此境，僧□兴废指前山。\n醉闻溪溜吟怀□，坐对岚峰世虑闲。\n他日功成重游赏，烟霞风物异尘寰。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15638,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题三桂亭","author":"陈尧咨","text":"不誇六印满腰悬，二顷仍寻负郭田。\n当日弟兄皆刷羽，如今鸿雁尽摩天。\n扶疏已问新栽柳，清浅犹寻旧漱泉。\n大尹今来还又去，夕阳旌旆复翩翩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15639,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"施肩吾宅","author":"陈尧咨","text":"幽居正想沧霞客，夜久月寒珠露滴。\n千年独鹤两三声，飞下岩前一株柏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15640,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日田园杂兴","author":"陈尧道","text":"化日村田乐，春风耕织图。\n秧肥科斗动，桑暗鹁鸠呼。\n罢社翁分胙，占蚕媪得符。\n傍花随柳处，此事不关吾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15641,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"弄水亭","author":"陈师孟","text":"新看滕阁旧游句，又见池亭弄水吟。\n千古才华少人敌，一生风韵为情深。\n向时行乐秾桃恨，此处重阳对菊心。\n昨夜清溪明月里，想君灵魄未消沉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15642,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和许伯翊访景山","author":"陈师服","text":"仙溪七十里，半世始闻名。\n一日见山面，千年怀友情。\n古匏浮晋醁，清水照尘缨。\n霜月亭亭白，连床话到明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15643,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽赵秋晓 其一","author":"陈师善","text":"风低健翮偶南翔，收敛虹霓万丈光。\n江左诸贤慕安石，贞元朝士独刘郎。\n尚期意气风云会，竟老英雄潦雾乡。\n如此典型今已矣，天乎莫诘意茫茫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15644,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽赵秋晓 其二","author":"陈师善","text":"惊呼事定隔存亡，天地无情此恨长。\n冷落席门怜曲逆，凄凉诗法忆濠梁。\n此生结习缘犹浅，晚景追陪愿未偿。\n珍重韩公遗稿在，忍将展玩怕情伤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15645,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十日二首 其二","author":"陈师道","text":"人生七十今强半，老去光阴已后身。\n更欲置身须世外，世间元自不关人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15646,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十日二首 其一","author":"陈师道","text":"一梦人间四十年，只应炊灶固依然。\n两官不办一丘费，五字虚随万里船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15647,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十七日观潮三首 其三","author":"陈师道","text":"漫漫平沙走白虹，瑶台失手玉杯空。\n晴天摇动清江底，晚日浮沉急浪中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15648,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十七日观潮三首 其一","author":"陈师道","text":"潮头初出海门山，千里平沙转面间。\n犹有江神怜北客，欲将奇观破衰颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15649,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十七日观潮三首 其二","author":"陈师道","text":"江水悠悠自在流，向人无恨不应愁。\n相逢不觉浑相似，谁使清波早白头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15650,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十八日观潮 其三","author":"陈师道","text":"千槌击鼓万人呼，一抹涛头百尺馀。\n明日潮来人不见，江边只有候潮鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15651,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十八日观潮 其二","author":"陈师道","text":"眼看白浪覆青山，谁信黄昏去复还。\n纵使百年终有尽，何须豪横诧吴蛮。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15652,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十八日观潮 其一","author":"陈师道","text":"一年壮观尽今朝，水伯何知故晚潮。\n海浪肯随山俯仰，风帆长共客飘摇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15653,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十八日观潮 其四","author":"陈师道","text":"江平石出涨沙浮，船阁平洲水断流。\n朝暮去来何日了，一杯谁与吊阳侯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15654,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三月二十二日榴花盛开戏作绝句","author":"陈师道","text":"五月榴花忽见春，白头喜遇一番新。\n可能略不解春意，只有寻枝摘叶人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15655,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"马上口占呈立之","author":"陈师道","text":"廉纤小雨湿黄昏，十里尘泥不受辛。\n转就邻家借油盖，始知公是最闲人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15656,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中秋夜东刹赠仁公","author":"张耒","text":"盈盈秋月不馀分，叶露悬光可数尘。\n此地正须烦一笑，要令排户问东邻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15657,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"从寇生求茶库纸","author":"陈师道","text":"南朝官纸女儿肤，玉版云英比不如。\n乞与此翁元不称，他年留待大苏书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15658,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以拄杖供仁山主二首 其二","author":"陈师道","text":"洗足投筇只坐禅，厌寻歧路费行缠。\n老来不复人间事，不用山公更削圆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15659,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"以拄杖供仁山主二首 其一","author":"陈师道","text":"错节孤根劲有馀，坐床须按起须扶。\n一生用底今相赠，更问林间有此无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15660,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"双樱","author":"陈师道","text":"并蒂随宜好，连心著意红。\n只堪惊老眼，持此与谁同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15661,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"巨野二首 其二","author":"陈师道","text":"蒲港侵衣绿，莲塘乱眼红。\n将身供世事，结缆待回风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15662,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"巨野二首 其一","author":"陈师道","text":"红落芙蕖晚，青深蒲稗秋。\n平湖无过鸟，鸣鼓有行舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15663,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月下观潮二首 其二","author":"陈师道","text":"素练横斜雪满头，银潮吹浪玉山浮。\n犹疑海若誇河伯，豪悍须教水倒流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15664,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"月下观潮二首 其一","author":"陈师道","text":"隔江灯火见西兴，江水清平雾雨轻。\n风送潮来云四散，水光月色斗分明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15665,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东禅","author":"陈师道","text":"东阡急雨未成泥，度密穿青取径微。\n邂逅无人成独往，慇勤有月与同归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15666,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"北渚","author":"陈师道","text":"南荡不可度，北渚风浪生。\n向来狐兔迹，已复蛟鼍鸣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15667,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏元弼 其二","author":"陈师道","text":"山头落日著窗明，花里来禽起笑声。\n岂有诗成须白傅，独于酒可置公荣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15668,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏元弼 其四","author":"陈师道","text":"车驰卒奔风雨过，白发故人馀一个。\n幸是元无左阿君，何须不著陈惊坐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":15669,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏元弼 其三","author":"陈师道","text":"翩翩别去七经年，特特归来两浩然。\n东道有时推谢令，后堂无地著彭宣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/P